    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spacious Three Bedroom Home with large sunroom\r\n\r\nPhoenix Estates are delighted to bring to the market No. 1 Bridgemeadow, Enniscorthy, Co. Wexford, a supremely finished three-bedroom residence offering superior living space of C,118 Sq metres. The Residence which is presented in stunning condition boasts a light-filled ground-floor layout featuring a spacious living room, open-plan kitchen-diner, and an impressive sunroom that opens onto an impeccably finished, private garden. Complete with a utility room, guest WC, three first-floor bedrooms (master en-suite), and family bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall: 3.46 x 2.17 – tiled floor, staircase to first floor, phone port\r\nLiving room: 4.5 x 3.50 – marble fireplace with wooden surround, currently fitted with an electric fire, laminated wood floor.\r\nKitchen: 5.1 x 4.2 - tiled floor, fitted kitchen eye and waist level units, breakfast counter, integrated oven, hob, fridge-freezer and dishwasher, tiled splash back, archway to sunroom.\r\nSunroom: 4.48 x 4.15 – semi solid wooden floor and patio door to the rear.\r\nUtility room:2.25 x 2.15 - tiled floor, fitted units, washing machine and dryer.\r\nW.C :2.2 x 1.6 – fully tiled floor and walls, W.C, WHB.\r\nMaster Bedroom: 3.5 x 3.41 -carpeted, fitted wardrobes\r\nEnsuite: 2.05 x 1.88 – fully tiled floors and walls, W.C, WHB, Free standing shower Triton T90SR  \r\nBedroom 2: 4.25 x 3.0 - carpeted, fitted wardrobes \r\nBedroom 3: 2.84 x 2.83 - carpeted, fitted wardrobes\r\nBathroom:3.0 x 1.95 - fully tiled floors and walls, jacuzzi bath, W.C, WHB"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tWell-positioned in Bridgemeadows estate.\r\n•\tPrivate parking\r\n•\tWithin walking distance and easy reach of Enniscorthy town centre and all local amenities.\r\n•\tHigh standard of finish throughout\r\n•\tPrivate patio area\r\n•\tRear garden\r\n•\tExtension to the rear\r\n•\tProperty being sold furnished"
      },
